    "tiptap_body": {
      "body": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "My view on this ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "My view on this "
              },
              {
                "type": "mention",
                "attrs": {
                  "sgid": "BAh7CEkiCGdpZAY6BkVUSSI8Z2lkOi8vanVtcHN0YXJ0LWFwcC9Db21tdW5pdHlNZW1iZXIvNjQ0MjE4NzU_ZXhwaXJlc19pbgY7AFRJIgxwdXJwb3NlBjsAVEkiFHJpY2hfdGV4dF9maWVsZAY7AFRJIg9leHBpcmVzX2F0BjsAVDA=--f980f32c16af094093bf1921730be3af7a0b8b3d"
                },
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "@Matt Clement"
              },
              {
                "text": " is that the best setup is the one you’ll actually use consistently. Complexity has a real cost, and in most cases, simpler systems win over the long run in business.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": " is that the best setup is the one you’ll actually use consistently. Complexity has a real cost, and in most cases, simpler systems win over the long run in business."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "At Empower Labs, we store all of our Master Prompt knowledge docs, SOPs, and workflows inside the Stage 3 software as our central source of truth. I use Claude (that still has our MP for context) for long-form writing and editing, marketing, deep reasoning, document analysis, summarization, creative content, and most project-based outputs like spreadsheets, projections, data summaries, and more.",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "At Empower Labs, we store all of our Master Prompt knowledge docs, SOPs, and workflows inside the Stage 3 software as our central source of truth. I use Claude (that still has our MP for context) for long-form writing and editing, marketing, deep reasoning, document analysis, summarization, creative content, and most project-based outputs like spreadsheets, projections, data summaries, and more."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "We use Claude Code for automated workflows among other things, and I personally use Gemini for vibe coding and landing page development, as I’ve found its visual output to be the strongest.  ",
                "type": "text",
                "circle_ios_fallback_text": "We use Claude Code for automated workflows among other things, and I personally use Gemini for vibe coding and landing page development, as I’ve found its visual output to be the strongest.  "
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "circle_ios_fallback_text": "My view on this @Matt Clement is that the best setup is the one you’ll actually use consistently. Complexity has a real cost, and in most cases, simpler systems win over the long run in business.At Empower Labs, we store all of our Master Prompt knowledge docs, SOPs, and workflows inside the Stage 3 software as our central source of truth. I use Claude (that still has our MP for context) for long-form writing and editing, marketing, deep reasoning, document analysis, summarization, creative content, and most project-based outputs like spreadsheets, projections, data summaries, and more.We use Claude Code for automated workflows among other things, and I personally use Gemini for vibe coding and landing page development, as I’ve found its visual output to be the strongest.  ",
