        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "I’m not ready to give up Perplexity or notebook LM, though i love Claude also.  Gemini is around because it comes with my google workspace, but I’m finding Claude queries gmails and docs better than Gemini.  I like including them all in my toolbox, and I find cross pollinating the work increases the value far beyond the subscription fees.",
